td>kW</td>\n<td>7.5</td>\n<td>11/15</td>\n<td>15/18.5</td>\n<td>15/18.5</td>\n<td>15/18.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\">— Feed System —</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3-Axis Motor Power (X/Y/Z)</td>\n<td>kW</td>\n<td>2/2/3</td>\n<td>3/3/3</td>\n<td>3/3/3</td>\n<td>4.5/4.5/4.5</td>\n<td>4.5/4.5/4.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rapid Traverse (X/Y/Z)</td>\n<td>m/min</td>\n<td>24/24/15</td>\n<td>24/24/15</td>\n<td>16/16/12</td>\n<td>12/12/12</td>\n<td>12/12/12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ballscrew Dia. × Pitch (X/Y/Z)</td>\n<td>mm</td>\n<td>X:36×4 Y:45×4 Z:40×8</td>\n<td>X:40×12 Y:40×12 Z:50×10</td>\n<td>X:40×12 Y:40×12 Z:50×10</td>\n<td>X:63×10 Y:50×10 Z:50×10</td>\n<td>X:63×10 Y:50×10 Z:55×12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\">— Accuracy —</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Positioning Accuracy</td>\n<td>mm/300mm</td>\n<td>0.005</td>\n<td>0.005</td>\n<td>0.005</td>\n<td>0.005</td>\n<td>0.005</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Repeatability</td>\n<td>mm/300mm</td>\n<td>0.003</td>\n<td>0.003</td>\n<td>0.003</td>\n<td>0.003</td>\n<td>0.003</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\">— ATC &amp; Power —</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tool Magazine Capacity</td>\n<td>pcs</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>24</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Power Requirement</td>\n<td>KVA</td>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>35</td>\n<td>35</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Air Pressure</td>\n<td>kg/cm²</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Machine Weight</td>\n<td>T</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>11.5</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>15.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Overall Dimensions (L×W×H)</td>\n<td>mm</td>\n<td>2,860×2,500×2,800</td>\n<td>3,200×3,000×3,100</td>\n<td>4,350×3,300×3,400</td>\n<td>4,480×3,800×3,800</td>\n<td>4,800×3,900×3,500</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><!-- ══ Section 2: MECHANICAL FEATURES ══ --><br>\nMechanical Features<br>\n🏗️<br>\nHigh-Rigidity Resin Sand Casting<br>\nThe machine bed is manufactured using resin sand casting and undergoes two rounds of artificial aging treatment, ensuring high strength, dimensional stability, and resistance to deformation over long-term use.<br>\nDouble Aging Treatment<br>\n⚙️<br>\nFull Taiwan Spindle System<br>\nThe complete spindle assembly is sourced from Taiwan, featuring imported P4-grade precision bearings assembled under constant temperature. Each spindle undergoes high-speed dynamic balancing for smooth, reliable operation.<br>\nP4-Grade Bearings<br>\n🔩<br>\nC3-Grade Precision Ballscrew<br>\nAll three axes use imported C3-grade precision ballscrews with double-nut preloading and tail-end pre-tensioning. This configuration delivers exceptional rigidity, minimizes backlash, and ensures long-term positioning accuracy.<br>\nDouble-Nut Preload<br>\n📏<br>\nLinear &amp; Rectangular Guideways<br>\nX and Y axes adopt linear guideways for low friction and high rapid traverse speed. The Z-axis uses rectangular guideways with imported wear-resistant scraped surfaces, providing superior rigidity and durability.<br>\nImported Wear-Resistant<br>\n🛢️<br>\nCentralized Lubrication System<br>\nThe entire machine uses a centralized lubrication system with pressure detection and volumetric oil distribution. This guarantees precise, metered lubrication to all critical components, extending service life significantly.<br>\nPressure Monitoring<br>\n🎯<br>\nHigh-Precision Three-Axis Configuration<br>\nThe three-axis system achieves positioning accuracy of ±0.005/300mm and repeatability of ±0.003/300mm, meeting the demands of precision mold making, aerospace components, and complex part machining.<br>\n±0.003mm Repeatability<br>\n<!-- ══ Section 3: Z-AXIS STRUCTURAL HIGHLIGHTS ══ --><br>\nZ-Axis &amp; Column Structural Advantages<br>\n<img src=\"https://qfcncmachine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/qiaofeng-L1060-z-axis-column-structure.webp\" alt=\"QIAOFENG L-1060 Z-axis column inverted V-shape structure detail\" width=\"600\" height=\"500\" data-srcpath=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/qiaofeng-L1060-z-axis-column-structure.webp\"></p>\n<h2>Precision Z-Axis Engineering &amp; Column Design</h2>\n<p>✓</p>\n<p><strong>Inverted V-Shape Column:</strong> The “inverted V” rib structure effectively increases column rigidity, suppresses vibration during heavy cutting, and eliminates machining chatter.</p>\n<p>✓</p>\n<p><strong>Counterbalance Design:</strong> The Z-axis adopts a counterbalance system to ensure consistent positioning accuracy and excellent cutting rigidity throughout the full stroke range.</p>\n<p>✓</p>\n<p><strong>Full Sheet Metal Machining:</strong> All sheet metal mounting surfaces are fully machined, ensuring precise alignment during assembly and simplifying maintenance procedures.</p>\n<p>✓</p>\n<p><strong>Dedicated Z-Axis Guard Design:</strong> The Z-axis protective cover features a specially designed contact surface that prevents the cover from scratching or damaging the guideways during operation.</p>\n<p>✓</p>\n<p><strong>True Coolant Separation:</strong> The genuine coolant-chip separation structure keeps the machine environment clean, improves coolant reuse efficiency, and enhances overall environmental performance.</p>\n<p><!-- ══ Section 4: DETAIL GALLERY ══ --><br>\nProduct Detail</p>\n<h3>BT40 Spindle Head</h3>\n<p>Taiwan-imported P4-grade bearings, constant-temperature assembly, high-speed dynamic balanced for smooth operation up to 8,000 rpm.</p>\n<h3>C3 Precision Ballscrew</h3>\n<p>Imported C3-grade ballscrew with double-nut preloading and tail-end pre-tensioning for zero backlash and long-term accuracy.</p>\n<h3>Precision Worktable</h3>\n<p>1,300×600mm working surface with standard T-slots (18T×5P×100), supporting up to 800kg workpiece load for heavy-duty applications.</p>\n<h3>24-Tool Disc ATC</h3>\n<p>Disc-type automatic tool changer with 24-tool capacity. Fast tool change cycle supports continuous multi-operation machining without interruption.</p>\n<p><!-- ══ CTA STRIP ══ --></p>\n<h2>Ready to Upgrade Your Machining Capability?</h2>\n<p>Contact our engineering team for customized solutions, pricing, and delivery schedules.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://qfcncmachine.com/contact/\">Get a Quote Now</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://qfcncmachine.com/contact/\">Contact Engineer</a><br>\n<!-- ══ END: QIAOFENG L-1060 Detail Module ══ --></p>",
